[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16440.15, "timestamp": "04:34:00", "text": "好的。 30秒。不，你不能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16448.709, "timestamp": "04:34:08", "text": "呃，它只能追溯到六秒钟前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16451.75, "timestamp": "04:34:11", "text": "一个男人。好的。有点像YouTube。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16454.629, "timestamp": "04:34:14", "text": "我至少很高兴我的YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16461.67, "timestamp": "04:34:21", "text": "今天确实有效，因为整个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16466.629, "timestamp": "04:34:26", "text": "那天我没开门。我确实打开了，但我尝试了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16475.029, "timestamp": "04:34:35", "text": "工作室。所以，它之前运行正常，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16477.31, "timestamp": "04:34:37", "text": "如果你继续使用 YouTube Studio 的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16479.51, "timestamp": "04:34:39", "text": "背景，如果选项卡自动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16482.31, "timestamp": "04:34:42", "text": "关闭时，它会切断进料流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16489.67, "timestamp": "04:34:49", "text": "疼痛。但是，对于 YouTube 来说，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16492.551, "timestamp": "04:34:52", "text": "AB1现已上线，可在线收听"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16495.75, "timestamp": "04:34:55", "text": "从今天起。它们并排添加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16497.629, "timestamp": "04:34:57", "text": "广告"}]